window.YW_GRAMMAR ={"name":"山东专升本英语 · 语法体系","scope":"五章递进：先五大句型（骨架）→ 词法（材料）→ 动词体系（心脏）→ 从句（嵌套）→ 特殊句式（拉分）。时态语态见 tenses.js","order":["五大句型","词法","动词","从句","特殊句式"],"chapters":[{"title":"第一章　句子骨架：从五大句型开始","desc":"英语所有句子都是五种基本句型的扩展。先认清骨架，后面的时态、语态、从句都是往骨架上加东西。","sections":[{"topic":"什么是句子：主语 + 谓语","item":"句子是能独立表达完整意思的语言单位，最小结构是【主语 + 谓语】。主语是陈述对象（谁/什么），谓语说明主语做什么或是什么。判断一个英文句子是否成立，只看两件事：有没有主语、有没有真正的谓语动词。","examples":["Birds fly.（鸟会飞）","He works.（他工作）","The sun rises.（太阳升起）"],"exam":"写作第一大坑：中文无主句直译成英文。如「下雨了」不能写 Rains.，要补形式主语 It rains. / It is raining."},{"topic":"句子成分全景（8 种）","item":"①主语（谁做）②谓语（做什么/是什么）③宾语（动作承受者）④表语（主语是什么/怎么样）⑤定语（修饰名词）⑥状语（时间/地点/原因/方式/程度）⑦补语（补充说明宾语或主语）⑧同位语（进一步解释前面名词）。五大句型就是这 8 种成分的五种最小组合。","examples":["The young teacher（主+定）teaches English（谓+宾）very carefully（状）.","We elected him（宾）monitor（宾补）.","Tom, our monitor（同位语）, is absent."],"exam":"考题常用「划句子成分」判断句型；能划出主谓宾，就能判断该用哪种句型改写。"},{"topic":"句型一：S + V（主谓）","item":"只有主语和谓语，谓语是不及物动词（vi.），后面不接宾语。常见不及物动词：happen, occur, rise, arrive, come, go, work, live, die, sleep, swim, cry, laugh, exist, disappear。可带状语，但状语不是宾语。","examples":["The accident happened yesterday.（事故昨天发生了）","He arrived late.（他到晚了）","They live in Beijing.（他们住在北京）— in Beijing 是状语，不是宾语"],"exam":"高频陷阱：happen / occur / rise / arrive / die 都是不及物动词，不能接宾语，也没有被动语态。× The accident was happened. → √ The accident happened."},{"topic":"句型二：S + V + O（主谓宾）","item":"谓语是及物动词（vt.），后接一个宾语。宾语可由名词、代词、不定式、动名词或从句充当。这是英文中最常见的句型。","examples":["She reads novels.（她读小说）","I want to go.（我想去）— 不定式作宾语","He enjoys swimming.（他喜欢游泳）— 动名词作宾语","We know that he is right.（我们知道他是对的）— 从句作宾语"],"exam":"动名词 vs 不定式作宾语：enjoy / mind / avoid / finish / suggest / practise + doing；want / hope / decide / plan / agree + to do。这是必考点。"},{"topic":"句型三：S + V + O + O（主谓双宾）","item":"谓语后接两个宾语：间接宾语（人，一般在前）+ 直接宾语（物）。典型动词：give, show, tell, teach, send, buy, bring, lend, offer, pass, promise, hand, write。可改写为「动词 + 直接宾语 + to/for + 间接宾语」。","examples":["He gave me a book.（他给了我一本书）= He gave a book to me.","She bought her son a toy.（她给儿子买了个玩具）= She bought a toy for her son.","The teacher told us a story.（老师给我们讲了个故事）"],"exam":"转换必备：用 to 的动词（give/show/send/tell/teach/lend/offer/pass）；用 for 的动词（buy/get/make/cook/find/sing）。写作用这个句型能加分。"},{"topic":"句型四：S + V + O + C（主谓宾补）","item":"宾语后面再加补语，补充说明宾语的状态、身份或动作。补语可以是名词、形容词、不定式、分词、介词短语。典型动词：make, let, have, get, keep, find, consider, call, name, elect, see, hear, watch, feel。","examples":["The news made him happy.（这消息使他高兴）— 形容词作宾补","We elected him monitor.（我们选他当班长）— 名词作宾补","I saw him cross the street.（我看见他过马路）— 不带 to 的不定式作宾补","Please keep the door closed.（请让门关着）— 过去分词作宾补"],"exam":"使役动词 make/let/have + 宾语 + do（不带 to），但变被动时 to 要还原：He was made to work. 感官动词 see/hear/watch 同理。"},{"topic":"句型五：S + V + P（主系表）","item":"谓语是系动词（linking verb），后面接表语说明主语的身份、性质或状态。系动词五类：①be（am/is/are/was/were）②感官：look, sound, smell, taste, feel ③变化：become, get, grow, turn, go, come ④保持：keep, stay, remain ⑤表象：seem, appear, prove。表语可以是名词、形容词、介词短语、不定式、从句。","examples":["She is a doctor.（她是医生）— 名词作表语","The soup tastes delicious.（汤尝起来很鲜）— 形容词作表语","He seems in trouble.（他好像有麻烦）— 介词短语作表语","The problem is how to solve it.（问题是如何解决它）— 从句作表语"],"exam":"高频陷阱：系动词后必须用形容词，不能用副词。× The soup tastes deliciously. → √ The soup tastes delicious. 这是选择题常考。"},{"topic":"特殊句型：There be 存在句","item":"表示「某地有某物」，结构为 There be + 名词 + 地点/时间状语。be 的单复数由后面第一个名词决定（就近原则）。可与情态动词、时态结合：There will be / There has been / There must be。","examples":["There is a book on the desk.（桌上有一本书）","There are two books and a pen on the desk.（就近原则：two books 决定用 are）","There will be a meeting tomorrow.（明天将有一个会议）"],"exam":"There be 与 have 的区别：There be 表「存在」，have 表「拥有」。× There has a book on the desk. → √ There is a book on the desk."},{"topic":"句子的三种规模：简单句 / 并列句 / 复合句","item":"①简单句：一套主谓，就是上面五大句型之一。②并列句：两套以上主谓，用并列连词（and, but, or, so, for, yet）或分号连接，地位平等。③复合句：一套主谓 + 从句（从句充当某个成分），用从属连词（that, which, because, when, if...）连接。三大类可嵌套组合。","examples":["简单句：He works hard.","并列句：He works hard, but he earns little.（but 连接）","复合句：He works hard because he wants to succeed.（because 引导状语从句）","复合句：The man who works hard will succeed.（who 引导定语从句，修饰 the man）"],"exam":"写作得分关键：只用简单句会被判「句式单一」。一篇作文至少要有 2 个复合句 + 1 个并列句。判断方法：数谓语动词个数，一套主谓=简单句，两套并列=并列句，两套有主从=复合句。"},{"topic":"五大句型速查表","item":"S+V 主谓（不及物）｜S+V+O 主谓宾（及物）｜S+V+O+O 主谓双宾（人+物）｜S+V+O+C 主谓宾补（补说明宾语）｜S+V+P 主系表（系动词+表语）。做题第一步永远是：找出谓语动词 → 看它后面有没有宾语 → 有几个 → 有没有补语 → 判断句型。","examples":["S+V: Time flies.（时光飞逝）","S+V+O: I love English.（我爱英语）","S+V+O+O: He told me the truth.（他告诉我真相）","S+V+O+C: They made him captain.（他们选他当队长）","S+V+P: She looks tired.（她看起来很累）"],"exam":"答题口诀：先抓谓语，再看后头；无宾是主谓，一宾是主谓宾，两宾是双宾，有补是宾补，系动是系表。"},{"topic":"五种基本句型","item":"主谓双宾；主谓宾宾补","group":"五种基本句型"},{"topic":"重点句型","item":"引导词：that（无义，不可省）、what（表“……的事/物”，必作成分）、whether（是否）、when/where、whoever(无论谁)/whatever（无论什么）、whose等。；Thathepassedissurprising.（that不可省）；It’sclearwhatheneeds.（it为形式主语，what从句是真主语）；引导词：that（可省，介词后不可省）、if/whether（是否）、what/which/who（作成分）等。；ifvswhether：whether可接ornot/todo，if不可（如：Iwonderwhethertogoornot）。；时态呼应：主句过去时→从句用相应过去时（客观真理用一般现在时，如：Hesaidtheearthisround）。；引导词：that（不可省）、what/which、when/where/why、asif（好像）。；例句：Thequestioniswhetherwecanarrive./Itlooksasifitwillrain.；引导词：that（不可省）。；例句：Thefactthatheliedsurprisedus.；分类：who（人，主/宾）、whom（人，宾）、which（物，主/宾）、that（人/物，主/宾）、whose（…的，定语）。；关键规则：；2.关系副词（作状语，=介词+关系代词）；介词+关系代词：介词由动词搭配/先行词决定（如：thebookaboutwhichwetalked→因talkabout搭配）。；as引导：such…as（如：Ihavesuchabookasyouwant）、thesame…as。；核心考点：引导词含义、时态规则、高频类别；时间：when（瞬/延续动词）、while（延续动词，表同时）、since（自从，主句现完时）、until（直到，否定句用not…until）。；条件：if（如果）、unless（除非=ifnot）；时态“主将从现”（主句将来时，从句现三单）。；原因：because（回答why）、since（已知原因）、as（语气弱）、for（必须逗号与主句隔开）、inthat、nowthat+从句前。；结果：so+形/副+that；such+名词短语+that。；让步：though/although（不与but连用）、evenif（即使）、as（必须倒装）、ever+疑问词（修饰名词倒装）、no+matter+疑问词（只能出现在状语从句）。；目的：sothat（为了，从句含can/may）、inorderthat。；方式：as（像…一样）、asif/though（好像，可接虚拟）。；比较：as…as（和…一样）、than（比）。；非谓语动词","group":"重点句型"},{"topic":"句子成分","item":"定义：句子中执行动作或被描述的主体，是句子的核心陈述对象。；充当成分：名词、代词、动名词、不定式、从句等。；Theboy（名词）likesmusic.；He（代词）isreading.；Readingbooks（动名词）isuseful.；Tosolvetheproblem（不定式）ishisgoal.；Whathesaid（从句）surprisedus.；定义：说明主语的动作、状态或特征，由动词/动词短语充当，是句子的“动作核心”。；简单谓语：单个动词，如Sheworkshard.；情态动词+动词原形：WecanspeakEnglish.；系动词+表语：Heishappy.；助动词+实义动词（表时态/语态）：Theyhavefinishedthetask.；定义：动作的承受者，分为直接宾语、间接宾语（双宾语）。；充当成分：名词、代词、动名词、不定式、从句等。；直接宾语：Iboughtabook（直接宾语）.；双宾语：Shegaveme（间接宾语）apen（直接宾语）.；动名词宾语：Ienjoyswimming（动名词）.；不定式宾语：Hewantstoleave（不定式）.；从句宾语：Iknowthatyouarebusy（从句）.；定义：修饰名词/代词，说明其属性、特征。；充当成分：形容词、名词、代词、数词、介词短语、分词、从句等。；前置定语：Atall（形容词）building.；介词短语：Thegirlinred（介词短语）.；分词短语：Themanstandingthere（现在分词）.；不定式短语：Hehassomethingtodo（不定式）.；从句：ThebookthatIbought（从句）isinteresting.；定义：修饰动词、形容词、副词或整个句子，说明时间、地点、原因、目的、方式等。；充当成分：副词、介词短语、分词短语、不定式、从句等。；时间：Hecameyesterday（副词）;Wemetat5p.m.（介词短语）.；地点：ShelivesinShanghai（介词短语）.；原因：Becauseitrained（从句）,westayed.；目的：Hestudieshardtogetgoodgrades（不定式）.；方式：HespeaksEnglishloudly（副词）;Shelookedatmewithasmile（介词短语）.；条件：Ifyouworkhard（从句）,youwillsucceed.；定义：跟在系动词后，说明主语的身份、特征、状态。；状态系动词：be（am/is/are等），如Heisastudent.；感官系动词：look/sound/smell/taste/feel，如Thecaketastesdelicious.；变化系动词：become/get/turn，如Shebecameateacher.；充当成分：名词、形容词、代词、介词短语、分词、不定式、从句等。；名词：Heisadoctor.；形容词：Sheishappy.；介词短语：Heisintheoffice.；分词：Thedoorisclosed（过去分词）;Themovieisexciting（现在分词）.；从句：Thequestioniswhetherwecango（从句）.；定义：补充说明主语或宾语的意义，分为主语补语和宾语补语。；主语补语：补充说明主语，常通过被动语态体现，如Hewasfounddead（主语补语）.；形容词：Wekeeptheroomclean.；名词：WecallhimJack.；分词：Isawhimplayingfootball（现在分词）;Hehadhishaircut（过去分词）.；不定式：Iaskhimtohelpme（带to）;Letmedoit（不带to）.；定义：对前面的名词/代词进行解释、说明，与被修饰成分“语法地位相同”。；充当成分：名词、代词、数词、从句（同位语从句）等。；名词：Mr.Li,ourteacher（同位语）,iskind.；数词：Youthree（同位语）gofirst.；从句（同位语从句）：Thenewsthathewon（同位语从句）istrue.；（注意：同位语从句是对名词“内容”的解释，that不充当成分；定语从句是“修饰”名词，that充当成分。）；定义：与句子其他成分无语法联系，独立存在的成分（如感叹词、称呼语、插入语）。；感叹词：Oh,that'samazing!；称呼语：Mary,comehere.；插入语：Tobehonest（插入语）,Idon'tagree./Heis,Ithink（插入语）,agoodchoice.","group":"句子成分"},{"topic":"谓语的核心","item":"后面可直接跟名词；后面不直接跟名词；可以直接跟形容词；无需使用被动态","group":"简单句"},{"topic":"简单句","item":"主语宾语的核心必须是名词；谓语/谓语结构；不及物动词；Shemade(him)(herassistant)🌟；对所修饰的名词起到补充作用","group":"简单句"},{"topic":"简单句的修饰和补充","item":"裸奔的名词；必须➕冠词/代词的名词；形容词作定语；前置定语的排序；名词作定语；介词短语作定语；一般用于说明地点、时间、原因、目的、条件、结果、方向、程度、方式等；副词作状语；介词短语作状语","group":"简单句"}]},{"title":"第二章　词法基础：各类词的用法","desc":"词是句子的材料。名、冠、代、形、副、介、连，各有各的位置和规则。","sections":[{"topic":"可数名词与不可数名词","item":"可数名词有单复数变化；不可数名词（water、advice、information、furniture）无复数、不接 a/an，量化用 a piece of / a bottle of 等。专升本常考：不可数名词的量化表达、可数与不可数同形词（paper 纸/论文、room 房间/空间）。","examples":["two pieces of advice（两条建议）","a piece of news（一则消息）","There is no room for doubt.（没有怀疑的余地）"],"exam":"高频：不可数名词量化 + 名词词义双解（room/paper）","group":"名词"},{"topic":"名词单复数变化规则","item":"一般加-s；以 s/x/ch/sh 结尾加-es；辅音+y 变 y 为 i+es；f/fe 结尾变 ves（leaf→leaves，但 roof→roofs）；o 结尾（tomato/potato/hero 加-es，photo/piano 加-s）；不规则变化（man→men、foot→feet、mouse→mice、child→children）。","examples":["leaf → leaves","tomato → tomatoes","photo → photos","child → children"],"exam":"高频：f/fe 结尾与 o 结尾的复数变化","group":"名词"},{"topic":"名词所有格","item":"有生命名词用 's；以-s 结尾复数只加 '；无生命名词用 of；双重所有格（a friend of my father's）；表示时间/距离/价值也可用 's（today's news、ten minutes' walk）。","examples":["ten minutes' walk（十分钟路程）","a friend of my father's（父亲的一个朋友）","the title of the book（书名）"],"exam":"高频：时间距离所有格 + 双重所有格","group":"名词"},{"topic":"复合名词的复数","item":"复合名词复数变化：主体名词变复数（passer-by→passers-by）；无主体名词则在词尾加-s（grown-up→grown-ups）；man/woman 修饰名词时两者都变（man doctor→men doctors）。","examples":["passers-by（路人）","men doctors（男医生）","grown-ups（成年人）"],"exam":"高频：passer-by 类复合名词复数","group":"名词"},{"topic":"不定冠词 a/an 的用法","item":"a 用于辅音音素前，an 用于元音音素前（an hour、an honest boy、an apple）；表泛指、首次提及、单位量词（once a week）；抽象名词具体化（a success、a surprise、a pleasure）。判断看音素不看字母：an hour（h 不发音）、a useful book（u 发/juː/）。","examples":["a university student","an hour and a half","It is a great pleasure to see you."],"exam":"高频：a/an 按音素选择（hour/university）+ 抽象名词具体化","group":"冠词"},{"topic":"定冠词 the 的用法","item":"表特指、独一无二的事物（the sun）、形容词最高级前（the best）、序数词前（the first）、乐器前（play the piano）、姓氏复数前表一家人（the Greens）、固定搭配（in the morning、on the right）。","examples":["the sun / the moon","play the piano","the Greens 格林一家","the more, the better 越多越好"],"exam":"高频：最高级/序数词/乐器前的 the","group":"冠词"},{"topic":"零冠词与固定搭配","item":"复数名词/不可数名词表泛指不用冠词；三餐/球类/学科/语言前不用冠词（have breakfast、play basketball、study English）；固定搭配 in hospital（住院）与 in the hospital（在医院里）、at table（在吃饭）与 at the table（在桌旁）意义不同。","examples":["have breakfast（吃早饭）","play basketball（打篮球）","go to bed（睡觉）"],"exam":"高频：有无冠词意义不同的固定搭配","group":"冠词"},{"topic":"人称代词与物主代词","item":"主格作主语，宾格作宾语；形容词性物主代词（my/your/his/her/its/our/their）+名词，名词性物主代词（mine/yours/his/hers/its/ours/theirs）独立使用（This book is mine.）。","examples":["This is my book. That is yours.","He helped me with my English.","A friend of mine 我的一个朋友"],"exam":"高频：形容词性/名词性物主代词互换（双重所有格）","group":"代词"},{"topic":"不定代词","item":"some 用于肯定句，any 用于否定/疑问句（some 用于疑问表请求）；复合不定代词（somebody/anybody/nobody/everything 等）作主语谓语用单数；形容词修饰不定代词后置（something new）；both/all/either/neither/none 用法区别。","examples":["something important（重要的事）","Both of them are students.（他们两个都是）","Neither answer is right.（两个答案都不对）"],"exam":"高频：复合不定代词谓语单数 + both/either/neither 辨析","group":"代词"},{"topic":"it 的用法","item":"指代天气/时间/距离；作形式主语（It is important to study English.）；作形式宾语（make it possible to do / find it difficult to do）；强调句型中的 it（It is...that...）。","examples":["It is raining heavily.","It is important that we (should) study hard.","I find it easy to learn English."],"exam":"高频：形式主语/形式宾语 + 强调句 it 的判别","group":"代词"},{"topic":"比较级与最高级","item":"单音节/部分双音节加 -er/-est，多音节前加 more/most；不规则变化（good/well→better→best、bad/badly→worse→worst、many/much→more→most、little→less→least、far→farther/further）；比较级+than，最高级+in/of 范围。","examples":["He is taller than I (am).","This is the most interesting book I have ever read.","The more you read, the more you learn."],"exam":"高频：不规则比较级 + the+比较级结构","group":"形容词与副词"},{"topic":"倍数表达法","item":"倍数 + as + 原级 + as（twice as long as）；倍数 + 比较级 + than（three times bigger than）；倍数 + the size/length/height of（twice the size of）。","examples":["This room is twice as large as that one.","He earns three times more than I do.","The bridge is three times the length of that one."],"exam":"高频：倍数的三种表达","group":"形容词与副词"},{"topic":"同级比较与修饰语","item":"as + 原级 + as（和……一样），not as/so + 原级 + as（不如）；修饰比较级的词：much/far/a lot/even/still/a little/a bit（much better、far more）。","examples":["She is as tall as her sister.","This problem is much more difficult than that one.","He runs not so fast as I do."],"exam":"高频：much/far/even 修饰比较级 + as...as","group":"形容词与副词"},{"topic":"常见介词搭配","item":"时间介词 in（月份/年/上午下午晚上）/on（具体某天/星期）/at（时刻/夜晚/周末）；动词+介词（regard...as、mistake...for、pay for、wait for）；形容词+介词（be good at、be interested in、be tired of、be proud of）。","examples":["in 2020 / on Monday / at 7 o'clock","regard...as 把……看作","be interested in 对……感兴趣"],"exam":"高频：in/on/at 时间介词 + 形容词介词搭配","group":"介词与连词"},{"topic":"并列连词","item":"and/or/but/so/for 连接并列成分；both...and...（谓语复数）、either...or.../neither...nor...（就近原则）、not only...but also...（就近）；并列句需连词或分号连接，不可只用逗号。","examples":["He is young but experienced.","Neither he nor I am a teacher.（就近）","Not only English but also Chinese is important."],"exam":"高频：就近原则连词 + 并列句连接","group":"介词与连词"},{"topic":"连词辨析","item":"because/since/as/for 表原因语气递弱；when/while/as 表时间区别（when 点/段、while 强调持续、as 强调同时）；if/whether 表是否（whether 可与 or not 连用、引导主语从句/介词后）；unless 表除非（=if...not）。","examples":["Since everyone is here, let's begin.","While I was reading, he came in.","I wonder whether he will come or not."],"exam":"高频：because/since/as/for 与 if/whether 辨析","group":"介词与连词"},{"topic":"词性","item":"实义动词；情态动词；连系动词；副词的作用","group":"词性"},{"topic":"介词后面必须跟名词或名词意群","item":"介词后面必须跟名词或名词意群","group":"介词"},{"topic":"介词短语在句中常做的成分","item":"后置定语；介词做表语；常见介词；复杂介词","group":"介词"}]},{"title":"第三章　动词体系：时态之外的动词规则","desc":"动词是句子的心脏。除时态语态（单独成册）外，还有情态、主谓一致、非谓语三大块。","sections":[{"topic":"can/could 与 may/might","item":"can/could 表能力/许可/可能性；may/might 表许可/推测（May I come in? / He may be at home.）；be able to 表经过努力做到（He was able to swim across the river.）。","examples":["She can speak three languages.","May I take a seat here?","He was able to finish the task on time."],"exam":"高频：can/be able to 区别 + may 表许可","group":"情态动词"},{"topic":"must 与 can't 表推测","item":"must + do 表对现在的肯定推测；can't + do 表对现在的否定推测；mustn't 表禁止；needn't 表不必；对过去的推测：must have done（一定做过）、can't have done（不可能做过）。","examples":["He must be very tired after the long walk.","That can't be Mary; she has gone to Shanghai.","You mustn't touch the wire. / You needn't apologize."],"exam":"高频：must/can't 推测 + mustn't/needn't 区分","group":"情态动词"},{"topic":"情态动词 + have done","item":"may/might have done（可能做过）、must have done（一定做过）、can't/couldn't have done（不可能做过）、should/ought to have done（本应做而没做）、needn't have done（本不必做却做了）、could have done（本来能做到而没做）。","examples":["He must have finished his homework.（一定做完了）","You should have told me the truth earlier.（本应早告诉）","You needn't have come yesterday.（昨天本不必来）"],"exam":"高频：should have done / must have done / needn't have done 三种核心含义","group":"情态动词"},{"topic":"need/dare 与 will/would","item":"need/dare 既可作情态动词（后接动词原形，用于否定/疑问）也可作实义动词（need to do / need doing；dare to do）；will 表意愿，would 表过去习惯/委婉请求；used to do（过去常常，现在不）与 be used to doing（习惯于）区别。","examples":["You needn't finish the work today.","He would sit under the tree reading when young.","I used to get up early, but now I don't.（过去常常）"],"exam":"高频：need 情态/实义双重身份 + used to/be used to","group":"情态动词"},{"topic":"就近原则","item":"either...or / neither...nor / not only...but also / not...but 连接并列主语时，谓语与靠近的主语一致；there be 句型同样就近。","examples":["Either you or he is wrong.","Not only he but also I am interested in music.","There are two books and a pen on the desk."],"exam":"高频：neither...nor / not only...but also 就近","group":"主谓一致"},{"topic":"就远原则","item":"主语 + with/together with/as well as/rather than/along with/except + 其他名词时，谓语与前面的主语一致。","examples":["The teacher together with his students is visiting the museum.","Tom as well as his parents likes music.","Nobody except the workers knows the secret."],"exam":"高频：with/together with/as well as 就远","group":"主谓一致"},{"topic":"集合名词与特殊名词","item":"family/class/team/group/government 等视作整体谓语用单数、视作成员用复数；people/police/cattle 恒用复数；the+形容词表一类人谓语复数（the rich/the poor/the young）。","examples":["The police are looking into the case.","The rich should help the poor.","His family are watching TV.（家人）"],"exam":"高频：family 类集合名词 + the+形容词复数","group":"主谓一致"},{"topic":"其他一致规则","item":"分数/百分数 + of + 名词，谓语与 of 后名词一致；each/every/either/neither + 单数名词谓语单数；时间/距离/金额作整体谓语单数（Ten years is a long time.）；a number of（许多，复）与 the number of（……的数量，单）。","examples":["Two thirds of the earth's surface is covered with water.","Each student has a dictionary.","The number of the students is increasing."],"exam":"高频：分数 of 结构 + the number of + 单数","group":"主谓一致"},{"topic":"不定式作主语与表语","item":"不定式作主语表具体/将来动作（To learn English well is important.，常用 it 形式主语：It is important to learn English well.）；作表语表计划/打算；It's + adj + for/of sb + to do（for 表客观，of 表人的品质：It's kind of you to help me.）。","examples":["It is necessary to finish the work on time.","It's kind of you to say so.（of 表品质）","Her dream is to become a doctor."],"exam":"高频：形式主语 it + for/of 区分","group":"非谓语动词·不定式"},{"topic":"不定式作宾语与宾补","item":"后接不定式的动词：decide/hope/want/plan/refuse/pretend/learn/manage/offer/agree + to do；作宾补：want/ask/tell/allow/encourage sb to do（带 to）；使役/感官动词省 to：make/let/have sb do、see/hear/watch/notice sb do（全过程），变为被动时 to 要回来。","examples":["She decided to give up smoking.","The teacher told us to be quiet.","I saw him cross the road.（被动：He was seen to cross the road.）"],"exam":"高频：省 to 动词（使役/感官）在被动中找回 to","group":"非谓语动词·不定式"},{"topic":"不定式固定句型","item":"too...to do（太……而不能）、enough to do（足够……能）、only to do（结果却）、so as to do/in order to do（为了）；不定式作目的状语；疑问词+不定式（what to do、how to do it、where to go）。","examples":["He is too tired to walk on.","She is old enough to go to school.","I don't know what to do next."],"exam":"高频：too...to / 疑问词+不定式","group":"非谓语动词·不定式"},{"topic":"动名词作主语","item":"动名词作主语表抽象/习惯性动作（Reading is interesting.）；It's no use/good doing（做……没用/没好处）；动名词作主语谓语用单数；动名词表一般/抽象，不定式表具体/将来。","examples":["Reading aloud is important for English learning.","It's no use crying over spilt milk.（覆水难收）","Swimming is my favorite sport."],"exam":"高频：It's no use doing 句型","group":"非谓语动词·动名词"},{"topic":"动名词作宾语","item":"后接动名词的动词：enjoy/finish/practice/mind/avoid/consider/suggest/keep/imagine/risk + doing；介词后一律用动名词（be good at doing、look forward to doing）；need/want/require + doing 主动形式表被动含义（= need to be done）。","examples":["He enjoys reading novels.","I am looking forward to seeing you.（to 是介词）","My watch needs repairing.（= needs to be repaired）"],"exam":"高频：look forward to doing 中 to 是介词；need doing 表被动","group":"非谓语动词·动名词"},{"topic":"动名词与不定式宾语辨析","item":"forget/remember/regret + doing（记得/忘记/后悔做过）与 + to do（记得/忘记/后悔去做）；stop doing（停止做）与 stop to do（停下来去做另一件事）；try doing（试着做）与 try to do（努力做）；mean doing（意味着）与 mean to do（打算）。","examples":["Remember to lock the door.（记得去锁门）","I remember locking the door.（我记得锁过门）","He stopped to smoke.（停下来去抽烟）"],"exam":"高频：forget/remember/stop/try 后 doing/to do 辨析","group":"非谓语动词·动名词"},{"topic":"现在分词作定语与状语","item":"现在分词表主动/进行：作定语（falling leaves、a sleeping baby）、作状语表伴随/原因/时间（Seeing the teacher, the students stood up.）；逻辑主语必须是句子主语（与主语是主动关系）。","examples":["The boy standing there is my brother.","Hearing the news, she burst into tears.","He came in, smiling.（伴随状语）"],"exam":"高频：分词作状语逻辑主语一致 + 主动关系","group":"非谓语动词·分词"},{"topic":"过去分词作定语与状语","item":"过去分词表被动/完成：作定语（fallen leaves、a broken cup）、作状语表原因/时间/条件/让步（Given more time, I could do it better.）；过去分词与主语是被动关系。","examples":["The window broken last night has been repaired.","Given another chance, he would succeed.","Written in English, the letter was hard to read."],"exam":"高频：过去分词作状语（given/seen 等）+ 被动关系","group":"非谓语动词·分词"},{"topic":"独立主格结构","item":"分词的逻辑主语与句子主语不一致时，给分词加自己的主语（名词/代词+分词），构成独立主格：Weather permitting, we will go out.；with 复合结构：with + 宾语 + 宾补（with the light on / with tears in his eyes）。","examples":["Time permitting, we will have a picnic.","He sat there, with his eyes closed.","The teacher came in, with a book under his arm."],"exam":"高频：with 复合结构 + 独立主格","group":"非谓语动词·分词"},{"topic":"时态语态","item":"主动：主语（三单）+动词-s/es；其他人称+动词原形。；被动：am/is/are+过去分词。；用法：表经常性动作、客观真理或现状。；主动：Sheplaystenniseveryweek.（习惯性动作）；Thesunrisesintheeast.（客观真理）。；被动：Theclassroomiscleaneddaily.（教室每日被打扫）。；主动：动词过去式。；被动：was/were+过去分词。；用法：表过去某时发生的动作/状态。；主动：IvisitedBeijinglastyear.（去年游览北京）。；被动：Theletterwaswrittenyesterday.（信是昨天写的）。；主动：will/shall+动词原形（shall多用于第一人称）；begoingto+动词原形（表计划/推测）。；被动：will/shallbe+过去分词；begoingtobe+过去分词。；用法：表将来发生的动作/状态。；主动：Wewillholdapartytomorrow.（明天办派对）；Itisgoingtosnow.（要下雪，推测）。；被动：Theprojectwillbecompletednextmonth.（项目下月完成）。；主动：am/is/are+doing（现在分词）。；被动：am/is/are+being+过去分词。；用法：表现在正在进行的动作，或现阶段持续的动作。；主动：*Heisreadinganovelnow.（现在读小说）；Theyarebuildingahospitalthisyear.*（今年建医院，现阶段动作）。；被动：*Anewbridgeisbeingbuiltovertheriver.*（河上正在建新桥）。；主动：was/were+doing。；被动：was/were+being+过去分词。；用法：表过去某时/段正在进行的动作。；主动：Iwascookingat6p.m.yesterday.（昨晚6点在做饭）。；被动：Theroadwasbeingrepairedlastweek.（上周这条路在维修）。；主动：have/has+过去分词。；被动：have/hasbeen+过去分词。；用法：表过去动作对现在的影响，或从过去持续到现在的动作（标志词：already,yet,since,for等）。；主动：*Ihavefinishedmyessay.（论文已完成，影响：可提交）；Shehaslivedherefor5years.*（住了5年，持续到现在）。；被动：*Thetaskhasbeendone.*（任务已完成）。；主动：had+过去分词。；被动：hadbeen+过去分词。；用法：表“过去的过去”（动作发生在过去某动作之前）。；主动：WhenIarrived,theyhadleft.（我到的时候，他们已经走了）。；被动：Theroomhadbeencleanedbeforewecame.（我们来之前，房间已被打扫）。；构成：have/hasbeen+doing（现在分词）。；用法：表从过去持续到现在且仍在进行的动作（强调持续性）。；示例：WehavebeenlearningEnglishsince2010.（从2010年学英语，仍在学）。；主动：would/should+动词原形（should多用于第一人称）；was/weregoingto+动词原形。；被动：would/shouldbe+过去分词；was/weregoingtobe+过去分词。；用法：表从“过去视角”看将来的动作（常用于宾语从句）。；主动：Hesaidhewouldcome.（他说他会来）；Theyweregoingtostarttheprojectlastmonth.（他们上月打算启动项目）。；被动：Shetoldmetheworkwouldbefinishedsoon.（她告诉我工作很快会完成）。","group":"时态语态"},{"topic":"复杂复合时态语态的写法","item":"复杂复合时态语态的写法","group":"谓语"},{"topic":"情态动词后面+V.原形","item":"情态动词后面+V.原形","group":"谓语"},{"topic":"非谓语作名词","item":"doing作名词；todo作主语、宾语","group":"非谓语"},{"topic":"非谓语作定语（修饰名词）","item":"doing作前置定语；done作前置定语；后置定语（难点）","group":"非谓语"},{"topic":"非谓语作其他修饰成分","item":"doing，done；todo作状语、补语，表目的；todo作状语、补语，表意料之外的结果","group":"非谓语"}]},{"title":"第四章　从句：把句子装进句子里","desc":"从句就是用一句话充当某个成分。按充当的成分分三类：名词性从句、定语从句、状语从句。","sections":[{"topic":"主语从句","item":"that 引导主语从句（常换 it 形式主语：It is certain that he will come.）；whether 引导（Whether we go remains a question.，不用 if 放句首）；what 引导表内容（What he said is true.）；whoever/whatever 表任何人/任何事。","examples":["It is well known that China is a great country.","What we need is time.","Whether she will come is unknown."],"exam":"高频：it 形式主语 + what 从句","group":"名词性从句"},{"topic":"宾语从句","item":"that 引导宾语从句（that 常省）；whether/if 引导；疑问词引导（Do you know where he lives?）；时态呼应：主过从过、客观真理保持一般现在；语序用陈述语序（I don't know what his name is.）。","examples":["I don't know where she has gone.","He asked me whether I could help him.","She said (that) she had seen the film."],"exam":"高频：宾语从句陈述语序 + 时态呼应","group":"名词性从句"},{"topic":"表语从句","item":"系动词后（be/remain/look/seem）；连接词 that/whether/as if/疑问词；The reason is that...（不可用 because）；That is why...（表结果）；The question is whether...。","examples":["The reason why he was late is that he missed the bus.","That is why I came here early.","It looks as if it is going to rain."],"exam":"高频：The reason...is that（不用 because）","group":"名词性从句"},{"topic":"同位语从句","item":"解释说明抽象名词（news/fact/idea/hope/truth/suggestion/belief）；that 引导时 that 不作成分、不可省略；与定语从句区别：that 在定语从句中作成分、在同位语从句中不作成分；whether 也可引导。","examples":["The news that our team won made us happy.","I have no idea when he will be back.","The suggestion that we (should) start early is good."],"exam":"高频：同位语从句 that 不可省 + 与定语从句区分","group":"名词性从句"},{"topic":"关系代词","item":"who（人，主格）/whom（人，宾格）/whose（人的/物的，作定语）/which（物）/that（人或物）；that 不能用于非限制性定语从句、不能紧接介词后；whom 作宾语可省。","examples":["The girl who is singing is my sister.","The book (that/which) I bought yesterday is interesting.","I know the boy whose father is a doctor."],"exam":"高频：whom 省不省 + whose 用法","group":"定语从句"},{"topic":"关系副词","item":"when（=in/on/at which 表时间）/where（=in/at which 表地点）/why（=for which 表原因）；先行词表时间/地点/原因，从句缺状语用关系副词，缺主宾表用关系代词。","examples":["I still remember the day when we first met.","This is the factory where my father works.","That is the reason why he was absent."],"exam":"高频：where/when/why 与 which/that 的选择","group":"定语从句"},{"topic":"只用 that 与只用 which 的情况","item":"只用 that：先行词为不定代词或 the+最高级/序数词/the very/the only 修饰时；只用 which：非限制性定语从句（He failed, which made him sad.）与介词后（the pen with which I write.）。","examples":["All that glitters is not gold.","This is the most beautiful place that I have visited.","He passed the exam, which surprised everyone."],"exam":"高频：the+最高级后用 that + which 指代整句","group":"定语从句"},{"topic":"as 引导的定语从句","item":"as 引导非限制性定语从句指代整句，位置灵活（As we know, the earth is round.）；固定搭配：as we know / as is known to all / as is often the case；such...as / the same...as。","examples":["As is known to all, Taiwan is part of China.","He is such a good student as everyone admires.","The same thing as happened to me happened to him."],"exam":"高频：as we know / as is known to all 固定结构","group":"定语从句"},{"topic":"时间状语从句","item":"when/while/as（当……时）；before/after/until/till/once/as soon as；hardly...when / no sooner...than / scarcely...when（一……就，主句过去完成时+部分倒装）；主将从现：时间从句用一般现在表将来。","examples":["When I got home, my mother was cooking.","While I was reading, he came in.","Hardly had she left when the phone rang."],"exam":"高频：hardly...when 倒装 + 主将从现","group":"状语从句"},{"topic":"条件状语从句","item":"if/unless（除非=if...not）/once（一旦）/as long as（只要）/provided that（假如）；主将从现；unless 表否定条件；in case（以防）。","examples":["As long as you work hard, you will succeed.","You won't pass the exam unless you study hard.","In case it rains, take an umbrella with you."],"exam":"高频：unless + 主将从现","group":"状语从句"},{"topic":"原因状语从句","item":"because（因为，回答 why、可被 not...but 强调）/since（既然，已知原因）/as（由于，明显原因）/now that（既然，新情况）；for 是并列连词表补充说明原因；The reason...is that 不用 because。","examples":["He was absent because he was ill.","Since you have finished your homework, you can go out.","Now that everyone is here, let's begin."],"exam":"高频：because/since/as/now that 语气递弱","group":"状语从句"},{"topic":"让步状语从句","item":"though/although（虽然，不与 but 连用但可与 yet/still 连用）、even if/even though（即使）、while（虽然，句首）、whether...or...（无论）、no matter + 疑问词 = 疑问词-ever；as 引导让步倒装（Child as he is, he knows a lot.）。","examples":["Although he is old, (yet) he works hard.","Whatever you do, do it well.","Try as he might, he couldn't solve the problem."],"exam":"高频：though 不接 but + no matter/ever 互换 + as 让步倒装","group":"状语从句"},{"topic":"目的/结果/方式/比较状语从句","item":"目的：so that/in order that + can/could/may/might；结果：so...that / such...that（so+形/副，such+名）；方式：as/as if；比较：than/as...as。","examples":["She spoke slowly so that we could understand her.","The box is so heavy that I can't carry it.","He talked as if he knew everything."],"exam":"高频：so...that 与 such...that 互换 + so that 目的","group":"状语从句"},{"topic":"含义：并列同类单词、短语、或并列谓语、句子","item":"含义：并列同类单词、短语、或并列谓语、句子","group":"并列句"},{"topic":"and","item":"并列同类的词与短语；别列句子与谓语动词","group":"并列句"},{"topic":"but","item":"并列同类词与短语；并列句子与谓语动词；but相关的特殊结构","group":"并列句"},{"topic":"or","item":"并列同类的词与短语；并列句子与谓语动词；or相关的特殊结构","group":"并列句"},{"topic":"含义：从句=主句的次要句子。有从句引导词（如that），有从句谓语","item":"含义：从句=主句的次要句子。有从句引导词（如that），有从句谓语","group":"从句"},{"topic":"从句类型的判断","item":"1缺名词=名词性从句；同位语从句、定语从句、状语从句的区分；简单区分：引导词不同；When；Where；When、Where从句只要不是名从，一律理解成“那时”“那地”","group":"从句"},{"topic":"名词性从句","item":"含义：整个从句作主语、宾语、表语、同位语；名词性从句（缺主语）；同位语从句；主语从句、宾语从句、表语从句、名词从句（一般是疑问句）；疑问句的方式理解；转成定语从句理解","group":"从句"},{"topic":"定语从句","item":"含义：整个从句作一个后置的形容词，用于修饰前面的名词；that（那个）==》人、物、事；which（哪个）==》物、事；who（谁）whose（谁的）whom（宾格谁）==》人；定语从句的介词前置（除that外）","group":"从句"},{"topic":"状语从句","item":"含义：整个从句作状语，用于修饰说明主语；Youwillbepunishedifyoudon’tfinishyourtask.；ever系状语从句","group":"从句"},{"topic":"从句的省略","item":"定从、名从引导词的省略（that引导；状语从句中，主语和be动词的省略（引导词+非谓）；支配、建议类谓语后的宾语从句可省略should；“xx很重要”型的it…that形式主语结构中，that从句可以忽略should","group":"从句"}]},{"title":"第五章　特殊句式：倒装、强调、虚拟","desc":"为了强调、平衡或表达假设，英语有几种打破常规语序的句式。专升本的拉分点在这。","sections":[{"topic":"完全倒装","item":"here/there/now/then + 动词 + 主语（主语是名词时倒装，代词不倒装：Here comes the bus. / Here he comes.）；方位副词/介词短语置首（Out rushed the children.）；表语/分词置首（Gone are the days when...）。","examples":["Here comes the bus.（公交车来了）","Out went the boy.（男孩出去了）","In front of the house stands a tall tree."],"exam":"高频：here/there 完全倒装（名词主语才倒装）","group":"倒装句"},{"topic":"部分倒装（否定词前置）","item":"never/hardly/seldom/little/rarely/not only...but also/no sooner...than/not until/under no circumstances + 助动词/系动词 + 主语；否定词修饰主语时不倒装（Hardly anyone passed the exam.）。","examples":["Never have I met such a kind person.","Not until midnight did he come back.","Seldom does he go to the cinema."],"exam":"高频：否定词开头的部分倒装","group":"倒装句"},{"topic":"only 与 so/neither/nor 倒装","item":"only + 状语置首，主句部分倒装（Only by working hard can you succeed.）；so + 助动词 + 主语（也……，肯定）；neither/nor + 助动词 + 主语（也不……，否定）；so 表确实如此时用 so + 主语 + 助动词（He works hard. So he does.）。","examples":["Only in this way can we solve the problem.","She likes music, so do I.","I haven't been there, neither has he."],"exam":"高频：only 倒装 + so/neither 倒装与 so he does 区别","group":"倒装句"},{"topic":"强调句型","item":"It is/was + 被强调部分 + that/who + 其余（强调人可用 who，其余用 that）；可强调主语/宾语/状语，不能强调谓语（强调动词用 do/does/did + 动词原形：He does like music.）；判别方法：去掉 It is/was...that 句子仍完整。","examples":["It was in the park that I met him.（强调地点状语）","It was Tom who broke the window.（强调人）","He did tell me the truth.（强调谓语动词 do）"],"exam":"高频：强调句型判别（去掉框架句子完整）+ 强调人用 who","group":"强调句与反意疑问"},{"topic":"not...until 的强调与倒装","item":"not...until 三种变形：正常（He didn't leave until midnight.）；强调（It was not until midnight that he left.）；倒装（Not until midnight did he leave.）；强调句中 not until 放被强调位置后主句不倒装。","examples":["It was not until he came that we began.（强调）","Not until he came did we begin.（倒装）","We didn't begin until he came."],"exam":"高频：not until 强调句不倒装 vs 倒装句","group":"强调句与反意疑问"},{"topic":"反意疑问句","item":"前肯后否、前否后肯；陈述句含 never/seldom/hardly/little/nothing 等否定词时，反意部分用肯定；祈使句反意用 will you（Let's 用 shall we）；I think/believe + 从句，反意问句与从句一致（I don't think he is right, is he?）。","examples":["He is a student, isn't he?","She never comes late, does she?","Let's go, shall we? / Open the door, will you?"],"exam":"高频：含否定词的反意问句 + 主从复合句反意","group":"强调句与反意疑问"},{"topic":"与现在/过去/将来事实相反的虚拟","item":"与现在相反：If + 过去式（be 用 were），主句 would/could/might + do；与过去相反：If + had done，主句 would have done；与将来相反：If + were to do / should do，主句 would do。","examples":["If I were you, I would study harder.","If he had come earlier, he would have met her.","If it should rain tomorrow, the match would be put off."],"exam":"高频：混合虚拟（主从句时态不同）+ were 型虚拟","group":"虚拟语气"},{"topic":"wish 与 if only 虚拟","item":"wish + 过去式（与现在相反，be 用 were）、wish + had done（与过去相反）、wish + would do（与将来相反）；if only 要是……就好了；as if/as though 貌似，从句虚拟同 wish。","examples":["I wish I were a bird.（现在）","I wish I had attended the lecture yesterday.（过去）","If only I could fly!（要是能飞就好了）"],"exam":"高频：wish 虚拟三种时态 + as if 虚拟","group":"虚拟语气"},{"topic":"建议/命令/要求的虚拟","item":"suggest/advise/propose/order/command/demand/require/request/insist + that 从句用 (should) + 动词原形；同源名词后的表语/同位语从句也用 (should) do；It's important/necessary/natural that... 也用 (should) do。","examples":["He suggested that we (should) set off early.","The doctor insisted that the patient (should) be operated on.","It is necessary that everyone (should) obey the rules."],"exam":"高频：suggest/insist 类虚拟 (should) do","group":"虚拟语气"},{"topic":"含蓄虚拟与其他虚拟句型","item":"without/but for/otherwise + 虚拟（Without your help, I would have failed.）；It's (high) time that + 过去式/should do；would rather + 过去式（I'd rather you didn't tell him.）；含蓄条件句（But for the rain, we would have arrived on time.）。","examples":["But for your advice, I would have made a mistake.","It's time we went to bed.（该睡觉了）","I would rather you came tomorrow."],"exam":"高频：without/but for 含蓄虚拟 + It's time 虚拟","group":"虚拟语气"},{"topic":"定语、主语、宾语的后置","item":"定语后置；主语后置；it做形式宾语；谓语+长宾语+补语结构的后置","group":"特殊语法"},{"topic":"强调语气","item":"itis/was…that…句型强调主语、宾语、状语；do，did，does强调谓语（仅限现在时和过去时）；sothat，too，to，such，that强调程度","group":"特殊语法"},{"topic":"倒装","item":"存在即合理，无需刻意还原语序","group":"特殊语法"}]}],"categories":{"名词":[{"id":"g01","topic":"可数名词与不可数名词","item":"可数名词有单复数变化；不可数名词（water、advice、information、furniture）无复数、不接 a/an，量化用 a piece of / a bottle of 等。专升本常考：不可数名词的量化表达、可数与不可数同形词（paper 纸/论文、room 房间/空间）。","examples":["two pieces of advice（两条建议）","a piece of news（一则消息）","There is no room for doubt.（没有怀疑的余地）"],"exam":"高频：不可数名词量化 + 名词词义双解（room/paper）"},{"id":"g02","topic":"名词单复数变化规则","item":"一般加-s；以 s/x/ch/sh 结尾加-es；辅音+y 变 y 为 i+es；f/fe 结尾变 ves（leaf→leaves，但 roof→roofs）；o 结尾（tomato/potato/hero 加-es，photo/piano 加-s）；不规则变化（man→men、foot→feet、mouse→mice、child→children）。","examples":["leaf → leaves","tomato → tomatoes","photo → photos","child → children"],"exam":"高频：f/fe 结尾与 o 结尾的复数变化"},{"id":"g03","topic":"名词所有格","item":"有生命名词用 's；以-s 结尾复数只加 '；无生命名词用 of；双重所有格（a friend of my father's）；表示时间/距离/价值也可用 's（today's news、ten minutes' walk）。","examples":["ten minutes' walk（十分钟路程）","a friend of my father's（父亲的一个朋友）","the title of the book（书名）"],"exam":"高频：时间距离所有格 + 双重所有格"},{"id":"g04","topic":"复合名词的复数","item":"复合名词复数变化：主体名词变复数（passer-by→passers-by）；无主体名词则在词尾加-s（grown-up→grown-ups）；man/woman 修饰名词时两者都变（man doctor→men doctors）。","examples":["passers-by（路人）","men doctors（男医生）","grown-ups（成年人）"],"exam":"高频：passer-by 类复合名词复数"}],"冠词":[{"id":"g10","topic":"不定冠词 a/an 的用法","item":"a 用于辅音音素前，an 用于元音音素前（an hour、an honest boy、an apple）；表泛指、首次提及、单位量词（once a week）；抽象名词具体化（a success、a surprise、a pleasure）。判断看音素不看字母：an hour（h 不发音）、a useful book（u 发/juː/）。","examples":["a university student","an hour and a half","It is a great pleasure to see you."],"exam":"高频：a/an 按音素选择（hour/university）+ 抽象名词具体化"},{"id":"g11","topic":"定冠词 the 的用法","item":"表特指、独一无二的事物（the sun）、形容词最高级前（the best）、序数词前（the first）、乐器前（play the piano）、姓氏复数前表一家人（the Greens）、固定搭配（in the morning、on the right）。","examples":["the sun / the moon","play the piano","the Greens 格林一家","the more, the better 越多越好"],"exam":"高频：最高级/序数词/乐器前的 the"},{"id":"g12","topic":"零冠词与固定搭配","item":"复数名词/不可数名词表泛指不用冠词；三餐/球类/学科/语言前不用冠词（have breakfast、play basketball、study English）；固定搭配 in hospital（住院）与 in the hospital（在医院里）、at table（在吃饭）与 at the table（在桌旁）意义不同。","examples":["have breakfast（吃早饭）","play basketball（打篮球）","go to bed（睡觉）"],"exam":"高频：有无冠词意义不同的固定搭配"}],"代词":[{"id":"g20","topic":"人称代词与物主代词","item":"主格作主语，宾格作宾语；形容词性物主代词（my/your/his/her/its/our/their）+名词，名词性物主代词（mine/yours/his/hers/its/ours/theirs）独立使用（This book is mine.）。","examples":["This is my book. That is yours.","He helped me with my English.","A friend of mine 我的一个朋友"],"exam":"高频：形容词性/名词性物主代词互换（双重所有格）"},{"id":"g21","topic":"不定代词","item":"some 用于肯定句，any 用于否定/疑问句（some 用于疑问表请求）；复合不定代词（somebody/anybody/nobody/everything 等）作主语谓语用单数；形容词修饰不定代词后置（something new）；both/all/either/neither/none 用法区别。","examples":["something important（重要的事）","Both of them are students.（他们两个都是）","Neither answer is right.（两个答案都不对）"],"exam":"高频：复合不定代词谓语单数 + both/either/neither 辨析"},{"id":"g22","topic":"it 的用法","item":"指代天气/时间/距离；作形式主语（It is important to study English.）；作形式宾语（make it possible to do / find it difficult to do）；强调句型中的 it（It is...that...）。","examples":["It is raining heavily.","It is important that we (should) study hard.","I find it easy to learn English."],"exam":"高频：形式主语/形式宾语 + 强调句 it 的判别"}],"形容词与副词":[{"id":"g30","topic":"比较级与最高级","item":"单音节/部分双音节加 -er/-est，多音节前加 more/most；不规则变化（good/well→better→best、bad/badly→worse→worst、many/much→more→most、little→less→least、far→farther/further）；比较级+than，最高级+in/of 范围。","examples":["He is taller than I (am).","This is the most interesting book I have ever read.","The more you read, the more you learn."],"exam":"高频：不规则比较级 + the+比较级结构"},{"id":"g31","topic":"倍数表达法","item":"倍数 + as + 原级 + as（twice as long as）；倍数 + 比较级 + than（three times bigger than）；倍数 + the size/length/height of（twice the size of）。","examples":["This room is twice as large as that one.","He earns three times more than I do.","The bridge is three times the length of that one."],"exam":"高频：倍数的三种表达"},{"id":"g32","topic":"同级比较与修饰语","item":"as + 原级 + as（和……一样），not as/so + 原级 + as（不如）；修饰比较级的词：much/far/a lot/even/still/a little/a bit（much better、far more）。","examples":["She is as tall as her sister.","This problem is much more difficult than that one.","He runs not so fast as I do."],"exam":"高频：much/far/even 修饰比较级 + as...as"}],"介词与连词":[{"id":"g40","topic":"常见介词搭配","item":"时间介词 in（月份/年/上午下午晚上）/on（具体某天/星期）/at（时刻/夜晚/周末）；动词+介词（regard...as、mistake...for、pay for、wait for）；形容词+介词（be good at、be interested in、be tired of、be proud of）。","examples":["in 2020 / on Monday / at 7 o'clock","regard...as 把……看作","be interested in 对……感兴趣"],"exam":"高频：in/on/at 时间介词 + 形容词介词搭配"},{"id":"g41","topic":"并列连词","item":"and/or/but/so/for 连接并列成分；both...and...（谓语复数）、either...or.../neither...nor...（就近原则）、not only...but also...（就近）；并列句需连词或分号连接，不可只用逗号。","examples":["He is young but experienced.","Neither he nor I am a teacher.（就近）","Not only English but also Chinese is important."],"exam":"高频：就近原则连词 + 并列句连接"},{"id":"g42","topic":"连词辨析","item":"because/since/as/for 表原因语气递弱；when/while/as 表时间区别（when 点/段、while 强调持续、as 强调同时）；if/whether 表是否（whether 可与 or not 连用、引导主语从句/介词后）；unless 表除非（=if...not）。","examples":["Since everyone is here, let's begin.","While I was reading, he came in.","I wonder whether he will come or not."],"exam":"高频：because/since/as/for 与 if/whether 辨析"}],"非谓语动词·不定式":[{"id":"g50","topic":"不定式作主语与表语","item":"不定式作主语表具体/将来动作（To learn English well is important.，常用 it 形式主语：It is important to learn English well.）；作表语表计划/打算；It's + adj + for/of sb + to do（for 表客观，of 表人的品质：It's kind of you to help me.）。","examples":["It is necessary to finish the work on time.","It's kind of you to say so.（of 表品质）","Her dream is to become a doctor."],"exam":"高频：形式主语 it + for/of 区分"},{"id":"g51","topic":"不定式作宾语与宾补","item":"后接不定式的动词：decide/hope/want/plan/refuse/pretend/learn/manage/offer/agree + to do；作宾补：want/ask/tell/allow/encourage sb to do（带 to）；使役/感官动词省 to：make/let/have sb do、see/hear/watch/notice sb do（全过程），变为被动时 to 要回来。","examples":["She decided to give up smoking.","The teacher told us to be quiet.","I saw him cross the road.（被动：He was seen to cross the road.）"],"exam":"高频：省 to 动词（使役/感官）在被动中找回 to"},{"id":"g52","topic":"不定式固定句型","item":"too...to do（太……而不能）、enough to do（足够……能）、only to do（结果却）、so as to do/in order to do（为了）；不定式作目的状语；疑问词+不定式（what to do、how to do it、where to go）。","examples":["He is too tired to walk on.","She is old enough to go to school.","I don't know what to do next."],"exam":"高频：too...to / 疑问词+不定式"}],"非谓语动词·动名词":[{"id":"g60","topic":"动名词作主语","item":"动名词作主语表抽象/习惯性动作（Reading is interesting.）；It's no use/good doing（做……没用/没好处）；动名词作主语谓语用单数；动名词表一般/抽象，不定式表具体/将来。","examples":["Reading aloud is important for English learning.","It's no use crying over spilt milk.（覆水难收）","Swimming is my favorite sport."],"exam":"高频：It's no use doing 句型"},{"id":"g61","topic":"动名词作宾语","item":"后接动名词的动词：enjoy/finish/practice/mind/avoid/consider/suggest/keep/imagine/risk + doing；介词后一律用动名词（be good at doing、look forward to doing）；need/want/require + doing 主动形式表被动含义（= need to be done）。","examples":["He enjoys reading novels.","I am looking forward to seeing you.（to 是介词）","My watch needs repairing.（= needs to be repaired）"],"exam":"高频：look forward to doing 中 to 是介词；need doing 表被动"},{"id":"g62","topic":"动名词与不定式宾语辨析","item":"forget/remember/regret + doing（记得/忘记/后悔做过）与 + to do（记得/忘记/后悔去做）；stop doing（停止做）与 stop to do（停下来去做另一件事）；try doing（试着做）与 try to do（努力做）；mean doing（意味着）与 mean to do（打算）。","examples":["Remember to lock the door.（记得去锁门）","I remember locking the door.（我记得锁过门）","He stopped to smoke.（停下来去抽烟）"],"exam":"高频：forget/remember/stop/try 后 doing/to do 辨析"}],"非谓语动词·分词":[{"id":"g70","topic":"现在分词作定语与状语","item":"现在分词表主动/进行：作定语（falling leaves、a sleeping baby）、作状语表伴随/原因/时间（Seeing the teacher, the students stood up.）；逻辑主语必须是句子主语（与主语是主动关系）。","examples":["The boy standing there is my brother.","Hearing the news, she burst into tears.","He came in, smiling.（伴随状语）"],"exam":"高频：分词作状语逻辑主语一致 + 主动关系"},{"id":"g71","topic":"过去分词作定语与状语","item":"过去分词表被动/完成：作定语（fallen leaves、a broken cup）、作状语表原因/时间/条件/让步（Given more time, I could do it better.）；过去分词与主语是被动关系。","examples":["The window broken last night has been repaired.","Given another chance, he would succeed.","Written in English, the letter was hard to read."],"exam":"高频：过去分词作状语（given/seen 等）+ 被动关系"},{"id":"g72","topic":"独立主格结构","item":"分词的逻辑主语与句子主语不一致时，给分词加自己的主语（名词/代词+分词），构成独立主格：Weather permitting, we will go out.；with 复合结构：with + 宾语 + 宾补（with the light on / with tears in his eyes）。","examples":["Time permitting, we will have a picnic.","He sat there, with his eyes closed.","The teacher came in, with a book under his arm."],"exam":"高频：with 复合结构 + 独立主格"}],"虚拟语气":[{"id":"g80","topic":"与现在/过去/将来事实相反的虚拟","item":"与现在相反：If + 过去式（be 用 were），主句 would/could/might + do；与过去相反：If + had done，主句 would have done；与将来相反：If + were to do / should do，主句 would do。","examples":["If I were you, I would study harder.","If he had come earlier, he would have met her.","If it should rain tomorrow, the match would be put off."],"exam":"高频：混合虚拟（主从句时态不同）+ were 型虚拟"},{"id":"g81","topic":"wish 与 if only 虚拟","item":"wish + 过去式（与现在相反，be 用 were）、wish + had done（与过去相反）、wish + would do（与将来相反）；if only 要是……就好了；as if/as though 貌似，从句虚拟同 wish。","examples":["I wish I were a bird.（现在）","I wish I had attended the lecture yesterday.（过去）","If only I could fly!（要是能飞就好了）"],"exam":"高频：wish 虚拟三种时态 + as if 虚拟"},{"id":"g82","topic":"建议/命令/要求的虚拟","item":"suggest/advise/propose/order/command/demand/require/request/insist + that 从句用 (should) + 动词原形；同源名词后的表语/同位语从句也用 (should) do；It's important/necessary/natural that... 也用 (should) do。","examples":["He suggested that we (should) set off early.","The doctor insisted that the patient (should) be operated on.","It is necessary that everyone (should) obey the rules."],"exam":"高频：suggest/insist 类虚拟 (should) do"},{"id":"g83","topic":"含蓄虚拟与其他虚拟句型","item":"without/but for/otherwise + 虚拟（Without your help, I would have failed.）；It's (high) time that + 过去式/should do；would rather + 过去式（I'd rather you didn't tell him.）；含蓄条件句（But for the rain, we would have arrived on time.）。","examples":["But for your advice, I would have made a mistake.","It's time we went to bed.（该睡觉了）","I would rather you came tomorrow."],"exam":"高频：without/but for 含蓄虚拟 + It's time 虚拟"}],"名词性从句":[{"id":"g90","topic":"主语从句","item":"that 引导主语从句（常换 it 形式主语：It is certain that he will come.）；whether 引导（Whether we go remains a question.，不用 if 放句首）；what 引导表内容（What he said is true.）；whoever/whatever 表任何人/任何事。","examples":["It is well known that China is a great country.","What we need is time.","Whether she will come is unknown."],"exam":"高频：it 形式主语 + what 从句"},{"id":"g91","topic":"宾语从句","item":"that 引导宾语从句（that 常省）；whether/if 引导；疑问词引导（Do you know where he lives?）；时态呼应：主过从过、客观真理保持一般现在；语序用陈述语序（I don't know what his name is.）。","examples":["I don't know where she has gone.","He asked me whether I could help him.","She said (that) she had seen the film."],"exam":"高频：宾语从句陈述语序 + 时态呼应"},{"id":"g92","topic":"表语从句","item":"系动词后（be/remain/look/seem）；连接词 that/whether/as if/疑问词；The reason is that...（不可用 because）；That is why...（表结果）；The question is whether...。","examples":["The reason why he was late is that he missed the bus.","That is why I came here early.","It looks as if it is going to rain."],"exam":"高频：The reason...is that（不用 because）"},{"id":"g93","topic":"同位语从句","item":"解释说明抽象名词（news/fact/idea/hope/truth/suggestion/belief）；that 引导时 that 不作成分、不可省略；与定语从句区别：that 在定语从句中作成分、在同位语从句中不作成分；whether 也可引导。","examples":["The news that our team won made us happy.","I have no idea when he will be back.","The suggestion that we (should) start early is good."],"exam":"高频：同位语从句 that 不可省 + 与定语从句区分"}],"定语从句":[{"id":"g100","topic":"关系代词","item":"who（人，主格）/whom（人，宾格）/whose（人的/物的，作定语）/which（物）/that（人或物）；that 不能用于非限制性定语从句、不能紧接介词后；whom 作宾语可省。","examples":["The girl who is singing is my sister.","The book (that/which) I bought yesterday is interesting.","I know the boy whose father is a doctor."],"exam":"高频：whom 省不省 + whose 用法"},{"id":"g101","topic":"关系副词","item":"when（=in/on/at which 表时间）/where（=in/at which 表地点）/why（=for which 表原因）；先行词表时间/地点/原因，从句缺状语用关系副词，缺主宾表用关系代词。","examples":["I still remember the day when we first met.","This is the factory where my father works.","That is the reason why he was absent."],"exam":"高频：where/when/why 与 which/that 的选择"},{"id":"g102","topic":"只用 that 与只用 which 的情况","item":"只用 that：先行词为不定代词或 the+最高级/序数词/the very/the only 修饰时；只用 which：非限制性定语从句（He failed, which made him sad.）与介词后（the pen with which I write.）。","examples":["All that glitters is not gold.","This is the most beautiful place that I have visited.","He passed the exam, which surprised everyone."],"exam":"高频：the+最高级后用 that + which 指代整句"},{"id":"g103","topic":"as 引导的定语从句","item":"as 引导非限制性定语从句指代整句，位置灵活（As we know, the earth is round.）；固定搭配：as we know / as is known to all / as is often the case；such...as / the same...as。","examples":["As is known to all, Taiwan is part of China.","He is such a good student as everyone admires.","The same thing as happened to me happened to him."],"exam":"高频：as we know / as is known to all 固定结构"}],"状语从句":[{"id":"g110","topic":"时间状语从句","item":"when/while/as（当……时）；before/after/until/till/once/as soon as；hardly...when / no sooner...than / scarcely...when（一……就，主句过去完成时+部分倒装）；主将从现：时间从句用一般现在表将来。","examples":["When I got home, my mother was cooking.","While I was reading, he came in.","Hardly had she left when the phone rang."],"exam":"高频：hardly...when 倒装 + 主将从现"},{"id":"g111","topic":"条件状语从句","item":"if/unless（除非=if...not）/once（一旦）/as long as（只要）/provided that（假如）；主将从现；unless 表否定条件；in case（以防）。","examples":["As long as you work hard, you will succeed.","You won't pass the exam unless you study hard.","In case it rains, take an umbrella with you."],"exam":"高频：unless + 主将从现"},{"id":"g112","topic":"原因状语从句","item":"because（因为，回答 why、可被 not...but 强调）/since（既然，已知原因）/as（由于，明显原因）/now that（既然，新情况）；for 是并列连词表补充说明原因；The reason...is that 不用 because。","examples":["He was absent because he was ill.","Since you have finished your homework, you can go out.","Now that everyone is here, let's begin."],"exam":"高频：because/since/as/now that 语气递弱"},{"id":"g113","topic":"让步状语从句","item":"though/although（虽然，不与 but 连用但可与 yet/still 连用）、even if/even though（即使）、while（虽然，句首）、whether...or...（无论）、no matter + 疑问词 = 疑问词-ever；as 引导让步倒装（Child as he is, he knows a lot.）。","examples":["Although he is old, (yet) he works hard.","Whatever you do, do it well.","Try as he might, he couldn't solve the problem."],"exam":"高频：though 不接 but + no matter/ever 互换 + as 让步倒装"},{"id":"g114","topic":"目的/结果/方式/比较状语从句","item":"目的：so that/in order that + can/could/may/might；结果：so...that / such...that（so+形/副，such+名）；方式：as/as if；比较：than/as...as。","examples":["She spoke slowly so that we could understand her.","The box is so heavy that I can't carry it.","He talked as if he knew everything."],"exam":"高频：so...that 与 such...that 互换 + so that 目的"}],"倒装句":[{"id":"g120","topic":"完全倒装","item":"here/there/now/then + 动词 + 主语（主语是名词时倒装，代词不倒装：Here comes the bus. / Here he comes.）；方位副词/介词短语置首（Out rushed the children.）；表语/分词置首（Gone are the days when...）。","examples":["Here comes the bus.（公交车来了）","Out went the boy.（男孩出去了）","In front of the house stands a tall tree."],"exam":"高频：here/there 完全倒装（名词主语才倒装）"},{"id":"g121","topic":"部分倒装（否定词前置）","item":"never/hardly/seldom/little/rarely/not only...but also/no sooner...than/not until/under no circumstances + 助动词/系动词 + 主语；否定词修饰主语时不倒装（Hardly anyone passed the exam.）。","examples":["Never have I met such a kind person.","Not until midnight did he come back.","Seldom does he go to the cinema."],"exam":"高频：否定词开头的部分倒装"},{"id":"g122","topic":"only 与 so/neither/nor 倒装","item":"only + 状语置首，主句部分倒装（Only by working hard can you succeed.）；so + 助动词 + 主语（也……，肯定）；neither/nor + 助动词 + 主语（也不……，否定）；so 表确实如此时用 so + 主语 + 助动词（He works hard. So he does.）。","examples":["Only in this way can we solve the problem.","She likes music, so do I.","I haven't been there, neither has he."],"exam":"高频：only 倒装 + so/neither 倒装与 so he does 区别"}],"强调句与反意疑问":[{"id":"g130","topic":"强调句型","item":"It is/was + 被强调部分 + that/who + 其余（强调人可用 who，其余用 that）；可强调主语/宾语/状语，不能强调谓语（强调动词用 do/does/did + 动词原形：He does like music.）；判别方法：去掉 It is/was...that 句子仍完整。","examples":["It was in the park that I met him.（强调地点状语）","It was Tom who broke the window.（强调人）","He did tell me the truth.（强调谓语动词 do）"],"exam":"高频：强调句型判别（去掉框架句子完整）+ 强调人用 who"},{"id":"g131","topic":"not...until 的强调与倒装","item":"not...until 三种变形：正常（He didn't leave until midnight.）；强调（It was not until midnight that he left.）；倒装（Not until midnight did he leave.）；强调句中 not until 放被强调位置后主句不倒装。","examples":["It was not until he came that we began.（强调）","Not until he came did we begin.（倒装）","We didn't begin until he came."],"exam":"高频：not until 强调句不倒装 vs 倒装句"},{"id":"g132","topic":"反意疑问句","item":"前肯后否、前否后肯；陈述句含 never/seldom/hardly/little/nothing 等否定词时，反意部分用肯定；祈使句反意用 will you（Let's 用 shall we）；I think/believe + 从句，反意问句与从句一致（I don't think he is right, is he?）。","examples":["He is a student, isn't he?","She never comes late, does she?","Let's go, shall we? / Open the door, will you?"],"exam":"高频：含否定词的反意问句 + 主从复合句反意"}],"主谓一致":[{"id":"g140","topic":"就近原则","item":"either...or / neither...nor / not only...but also / not...but 连接并列主语时，谓语与靠近的主语一致；there be 句型同样就近。","examples":["Either you or he is wrong.","Not only he but also I am interested in music.","There are two books and a pen on the desk."],"exam":"高频：neither...nor / not only...but also 就近"},{"id":"g141","topic":"就远原则","item":"主语 + with/together with/as well as/rather than/along with/except + 其他名词时，谓语与前面的主语一致。","examples":["The teacher together with his students is visiting the museum.","Tom as well as his parents likes music.","Nobody except the workers knows the secret."],"exam":"高频：with/together with/as well as 就远"},{"id":"g142","topic":"集合名词与特殊名词","item":"family/class/team/group/government 等视作整体谓语用单数、视作成员用复数；people/police/cattle 恒用复数；the+形容词表一类人谓语复数（the rich/the poor/the young）。","examples":["The police are looking into the case.","The rich should help the poor.","His family are watching TV.（家人）"],"exam":"高频：family 类集合名词 + the+形容词复数"},{"id":"g143","topic":"其他一致规则","item":"分数/百分数 + of + 名词，谓语与 of 后名词一致；each/every/either/neither + 单数名词谓语单数；时间/距离/金额作整体谓语单数（Ten years is a long time.）；a number of（许多，复）与 the number of（……的数量，单）。","examples":["Two thirds of the earth's surface is covered with water.","Each student has a dictionary.","The number of the students is increasing."],"exam":"高频：分数 of 结构 + the number of + 单数"}],"情态动词":[{"id":"g150","topic":"can/could 与 may/might","item":"can/could 表能力/许可/可能性；may/might 表许可/推测（May I come in? / He may be at home.）；be able to 表经过努力做到（He was able to swim across the river.）。","examples":["She can speak three languages.","May I take a seat here?","He was able to finish the task on time."],"exam":"高频：can/be able to 区别 + may 表许可"},{"id":"g151","topic":"must 与 can't 表推测","item":"must + do 表对现在的肯定推测；can't + do 表对现在的否定推测；mustn't 表禁止；needn't 表不必；对过去的推测：must have done（一定做过）、can't have done（不可能做过）。","examples":["He must be very tired after the long walk.","That can't be Mary; she has gone to Shanghai.","You mustn't touch the wire. / You needn't apologize."],"exam":"高频：must/can't 推测 + mustn't/needn't 区分"},{"id":"g152","topic":"情态动词 + have done","item":"may/might have done（可能做过）、must have done（一定做过）、can't/couldn't have done（不可能做过）、should/ought to have done（本应做而没做）、needn't have done（本不必做却做了）、could have done（本来能做到而没做）。","examples":["He must have finished his homework.（一定做完了）","You should have told me the truth earlier.（本应早告诉）","You needn't have come yesterday.（昨天本不必来）"],"exam":"高频：should have done / must have done / needn't have done 三种核心含义"},{"id":"g153","topic":"need/dare 与 will/would","item":"need/dare 既可作情态动词（后接动词原形，用于否定/疑问）也可作实义动词（need to do / need doing；dare to do）；will 表意愿，would 表过去习惯/委婉请求；used to do（过去常常，现在不）与 be used to doing（习惯于）区别。","examples":["You needn't finish the work today.","He would sit under the tree reading when young.","I used to get up early, but now I don't.（过去常常）"],"exam":"高频：need 情态/实义双重身份 + used to/be used to"}]}};
